{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the LOST ALTR Demo you will be able to play the Neophyte (Easy) and Adeptus (Standard) Single Trial Modes. Hierophant (Journey) is only available in the full-version.</strong><i><br><br>LOST ALTR</i> is a solo rogue-lite card game set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the Ruins of ALTR. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681250?t=1745370116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681250/cc11e603ded4d4bcc7d4390994418407409d43d5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745370116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681250/24a86fb8096e47111146d91f69860f7fc66fda68/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745370116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681250/24a86fb8096e47111146d91f69860f7fc66fda68/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745370116","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"LOST ALTR contains themes and imagery that may not be suitable for all players. This includes dark esoteric symbolism, references to ritual practices, bloodletting, and self-sacrifice. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the LOST ALTR De